  "description": "OCOGEW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H82 Dy4 N10 O16,2(C2 H6 O1),3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.509-3.891 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.42-113.11°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(L1)4(NO3)2(μ3-OH)2]·2C2H5OH·3H2O (C80H98Dy4N10O21; H2L1 from 2-hydroxybenzaldehyde and 2,2-dimethylpropane-1,3-diamine). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
